Hi,

3 of the 100 answers about Bakkerij Jansen are wrong

Dot: red. AI sends customers away. At least one answer sends customers away. We fix that first.

On 2 October 2026 we put 100 questions about Bakkerij Jansen to ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Google AI, Copilot.

Per AI: ChatGPT: red, Gemini: green, Perplexity: orange, Google AI: green, Copilot: grey.

100 answers checked · 3 were wrong

The most important errors

About: the opening hours on Sunday
ChatGPT said: 10:00 to 14:00 (7 of 10 times)
Wrong. It is: closed
Where it comes from: openingstijden.nl

About: the phone number
ChatGPT said: +31231234568 (2 of 10 times)
Wrong. It is: +31231234567
Where it comes from: openingstijden.nl

Recommendation question about: whether desembrood is offered
ChatGPT does not name you (7 of 10 times)
You are not named, even though this applies to you. Your detail is: yes
No source: this detail is nowhere AI can read it.

See your full result: https://vidalo.io/en/r/run1
Rather have us fix it? Setup costs €149 once, monitoring €49 a month, cancel any month. Prices excl. VAT.

How we fix it
- Day 1: We record your details and put your facts page live.
- Week 1: We submit corrections to the sources: the directories, Google, Bing and Apple.
- Weeks 1 to 4: We check every source again. You see per answer whether it is right again.
- Every month: A new check of all questions, with a short report.

Best,
Vidalo
"
`;

