"Welcome to Vidalo: 4 steps for Bakkerij Jansen

Hi,

Welcome. This is how we start for Bakkerij Jansen.

Thank you for your order. From now on we check what AI says about Bakkerij Jansen and fix errors at the source. To start, we need 4 things from you, about 5 minutes in all.

1. Confirm your details
Address, phone, opening hours, what you do and do not do. We have filled them in already; you check them.

2. One DNS record
Create a CNAME record with your domain provider:
feiten.bakkerijjansen.nl  →  feiten.vidalo.io
We check every 10 minutes whether it is there. If it does not work, we put the page on our own address.

3. Log in to Google once
This lets us read your Google Business Profile and bring the opening hours, the phone number and the website in line.
https://vidalo.io/en/app/google

4. We do the rest
Once your DNS record is in place, your facts page is live. We update your Google profile straight away; at Bing and Apple we submit the change and follow it until it is processed.

